  >
  </div>


## Reflection

#### In the next level, you will notice a new file type: `reflection.md.`

#### These files give students space to reflect on their learning. 

#### Reflection supports deeper understanding by prompting students to synthesize their thinking, describe their decisions, and make connections between the activity and the broader concepts.

<div style="clear:both;"></div>

## PAIR Framework: Prompt – Analyze – Integrate – Reflect

#### As you work, remember to use the PAIR framework. The Reflect step is especially important in AI-supported learning. Use the `reflection.md` file to complete the R – Reflect portion of the process. Encourage students to do the same during classroom instruction.

MARKDOWN
